 "about": "Known answers of the committed-data leaf (RecursionFast/Contract/Relation.lean), computed by the pure-Python reference harness/rfh/digest.py and checked by service/src/lib.rs (cargo test), tests/harness/test_leaf.py (the toy prover's C dataRoot) and the Lean controls. Keccak-256 is Ethereum's. leafItem x = Keccak-256(0x48 || x); dataNode l r = Keccak-256(0x44 || l || r); dataRoot pairs adjacent digests level by level from the leafItems, an odd last digest carried up unhashed (the zero digest for no block); leafStmt h n = Keccak-256(0x4C || h || enc64 n), enc64 8 bytes little-endian. 3 blocks: dataNode (dataNode i0 i1) i2; 4 blocks: dataNode (dataNode i0 i1) (dataNode i2 i3).",
